{"test_id":"distractor_941094","arm":"distractor_reject","source_timestamp":1775679948,"formatted_timestamp":"20:25, 04/08/2026","user_query":"static cling on my clothes is brutal in winter, fix?","prior_conversation":[],"action":"asked_chatbot","source_hashtags":[],"held_out_preference":null,"blind_check_score":null,"blind_check_generic_answer":null,"privacy_flagged_prefs":[{"persona_item":"Engages with hip-hop radio and media content, especially outlets like Hot 97.","category":"hip-hop media"},{"persona_item":"Enjoys 1990s golden-era hip-hop.","category":"hip-hop music"},{"persona_item":"Enjoys Disney-owned franchise shows and movies, especially Marvel and Star Wars titles.","category":"film and tv fandom"},{"persona_item":"Enjoys classic hip-hop culture and legacy rap figures.","category":"hip-hop culture"},{"persona_item":"Enjoys comedy and satirical entertainment.","category":"comedy entertainment"},{"persona_item":"Enjoys comedy content on social media.","category":"comedy entertainment"},{"persona_item":"Enjoys hip-hop dance content and dance challenge videos.","category":"dance"}],"top_k_relevant_prefs":[],"gt_slice":{"target":[],"avoid":[],"t_test":1775679948,"window_seconds":86400},"post_test_window":{"post_test_positives":[],"post_test_negatives":[]},"irrelevant_persona_items":["Engages with hip-hop radio and media content, especially outlets like Hot 97.","Enjoys 1990s golden-era hip-hop.","Enjoys Disney-owned franchise shows and movies, especially Marvel and Star Wars titles.","Enjoys classic hip-hop culture and legacy rap figures.","Enjoys comedy and satirical entertainment.","Enjoys comedy content on social media.","Enjoys hip-hop dance content and dance challenge videos."],"_distractor_reject":true,"example_response":"Static cling is usually from dry air, so add moisture and cut friction: use a humidifier, try dryer sheets or wool dryer balls, and lightly mist clothes with water or rub a tiny amount of lotion on your hands before dressing. Wearing natural fibers like cotton and avoiding over-drying laundry also helps a lot.","groundtruth_preference":"Preferences in profile that must NOT be surfaced (any of them):
  (none identified)

Expected behavior: generic, well-researched answer to the user's question — do NOT lean on any of the above.","example_response_self_check":{"score":3,"passed":true,"reason":"Directly answers the question with practical fixes for winter static cling."},"inferior_response":{"text":"Winter static is mostly about dry air and too much friction, so aim to add a little moisture and reduce rubbing. A humidifier helps, and dryer sheets or wool balls can cut buildup in the laundry. If you want something low-key, a quick mist of water or a dab of lotion on your hands can work before getting dressed, and hip-hop music in the background somehow makes the whole chore feel less annoying.","flaw_kind":"over_personalization","flaw_evidence":{"persona_item":"hip-hop music"}}}

